---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><title>Playback privacy · Karaoke</title></head>
  <body style="margin:0;background:#131211;color:#f5f0e6;font:16px system-ui,sans-serif">
    <main style="max-width:680px;margin:64px auto;padding:24px;line-height:1.7">
      <h1>Playback verification</h1>
      <p>Fantaisie-Impromptu uses Cloudflare Turnstile to check automated access before playback. Cloudflare processes browser and network information for this check, including your IP address.</p>
      <p>See the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/" style="color:#deb668">Cloudflare Turnstile Privacy Addendum</a> for details.</p>
      <p>The player uses a secure cookie that expires after 15 minutes to authorize requests for this recording and its arrangement. It is renewed while you play. Playback remains available without signing in.</p>
      <a href="/" style="color:#deb668">Back to Karaoke</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
